# Tel Input

A comprehensive phone number input component with country code selection, automatic formatting, and flag support.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/tel-input.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/tel-input.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/tel-input.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { TelInput } from '@/registry/tel-input'

const phoneNumber = ref('')
</script>

<template>
  <TelInput 
    v-model="phoneNumber" 
    placeholder="Enter phone number" 
  />
</template>
```

