### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `placeholder` | `string` | `'Número de teléfono'` | Input placeholder text. |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Whether the input is disabled. |
| `v-model` | `string` | `undefined` | The formatted international phone number. |
| `defaultCountry` | `string` | `'CU'` | Default country code (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2). |
| `searchPlaceholder` | `string` | `'Buscar país...'` | Placeholder for the country search input. |
